mkdir - make directories

SYNOPSIS
    mkdir [-p] directory ...

DESCRIPTION
    Create each directory. With -p, create missing parents and accept
    directories that already exist. The shell's umask applies to newly
    created directories. A failure on one operand still allows the
    remaining operands to be processed.

EXIT STATUS
    Zero on success, one on a creation error, or two for invalid usage.

SEE ALSO
    ls(1), rmdir(1), umask(1)
